+| `TestCommitWeft_MachineLocalArtifactsNeverEnterWeftTreeAtAnyDepth` | 1.03 | 9 | 291 |
+| `TestStates` | 0.97 | 18 | 444 |
+| `TestWireJunctions_ScratchLink` | 0.87 | 2 | 382 |
